{
  "info": {
    "name": "JSView — Purchase Request & Purchase Order",
    "description": "# JSView Purchase Request (PR) and Purchase Order (PO)\n\nThere is **no separate PR URL**. PR and PO share `POST {{baseUrl}}/api/purchase-order/po/`. The only difference is `potype`.\n\n| Type | `potype` | Header `vendorid` | Lines |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Purchase Request | `REQUEST` | `null` | Nested `items`. Live cost card. No snapshot. |\n| Purchase Order | `ORDER` | set to vendor PK | Nested `items`. `costcardid` snapshots on save. |\n\nSet collection variables (`customerId`, `vendorId`, `costcardId`, `stampId`, `acexeId`, `termsId`) to real PKs. Send `Authorization: Token {{token}}` on the collection.\n\n**Do not send:** `prepby` (logged-in user), `pono` / `npono` / `nyear`, `poid` on `items`, `lines`, `*_name` fields.\n\nWrite body uses `items`. Read body returns `lines`.\n\n**Required:** `podate` (`YYYY-MM-DD`). `costcardid` is optional (`null` if no card).\n\nConvert PR → PO: POST `potype: ORDER` with `linkid` = PR pk.\n",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "apikey",
    "apikey": [
      { "key": "key", "value": "Authorization", "type": "string" },
      { "key": "value", "value": "Token {{token}}", "type": "string" },
      { "key": "in", "value": "header", "type": "string" }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8000" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "prId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "poId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "lineId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "customerId", "value": "12" },
    { "key": "vendorId", "value": "34" },
    { "key": "costcardId", "value": "56" },
    { "key": "stampId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "acexeId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "termsId", "value": "1" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Purchase Request (potype=REQUEST)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List purchase requests",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "description": "Filter with `potype=REQUEST` so ORDER rows are excluded.",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/purchase-order/po/?potype=REQUEST&active=true&limit=20&offset=0&search=&ordering=-podate"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create purchase request",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (j.pk) pm.collectionVariables.set('prId', String(j.pk));",
                  "  pm.test('PR created', () => pm.expect(j.potype).to.eql('REQUEST'));",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "description": "Creates the PR header then `items` in one POST. Header `vendorid` is null. Do not send `prepby` or item `poid`. `tqty` 0 is summed from item qty. Saves `prId` on 201.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"potype\": \"REQUEST\",\n  \"podate\": \"2026-09-15\",\n  \"ddate\": \"2026-10-01\",\n  \"customerid\": {{customerId}},\n  \"customer_pono\": \"CUST-PR-001\",\n  \"pocategory\": \"Production\",\n  \"stampid\": {{stampId}},\n  \"acexeid\": {{acexeId}},\n  \"termsid\": {{termsId}},\n  \"vendorid\": null,\n  \"vcsdate\": null,\n  \"rem\": \"Remarks\",\n  \"note\": \"Internal note\",\n  \"tqty\": 0,\n  \"active\": true,\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"costcardid\": {{costcardId}},\n      \"styleno\": \"JS-001\",\n      \"vstyleno\": \"V-001\",\n      \"vendorid\": {{vendorId}},\n      \"qty\": 10,\n      \"size\": \"7,8,9\",\n      \"spcs\": \"4,3,3\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"costcardid\": {{costcardId}},\n      \"styleno\": \"JS-002\",\n      \"vstyleno\": \"V-002\",\n      \"vendorid\": {{vendorId}},\n      \"qty\": 5,\n      \"size\": \"6\",\n      \"spcs\": \"5\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/purchase-order/po/"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get purchase request detail",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "description": "Response includes `prepby`, `prepby_username`, and nested `lines` (not `items`).",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/purchase-order/po/{{prId}}/"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update purchase request",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "description": "Partial update. PATCH does not replace `items`. Do not change `potype` to ORDER here.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"rem\": \"Updated remarks\",\n  \"ddate\": \"2026-10-15\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/purchase-order/po/{{prId}}/"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List lines for this PR",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "description": "Only lines whose `poid` is this request.",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/purchase-order/po/{{prId}}/lines/"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Add extra line to this PR",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (j.pk) pm.collectionVariables.set('lineId', String(j.pk));",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "description": "Optional extra line after nested create. `poid` is required on this endpoint only.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"poid\": {{prId}},\n  \"costcardid\": {{costcardId}},\n  \"styleno\": \"JS-003\",\n  \"vstyleno\": \"V-003\",\n  \"vendorid\": {{vendorId}},\n  \"qty\": 2,\n  \"size\": \"8\",\n  \"spcs\": \"2\",\n  \"active\": true\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/purchase-order/po-line/"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete purchase request",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "description": "Cascades header lines.",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/purchase-order/po/{{prId}}/"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Purchase Order (potype=ORDER)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List purchase orders",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "description": "Filter with `potype=ORDER`.",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/purchase-order/po/?potype=ORDER&active=true&limit=20&offset=0&ordering=-podate"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create purchase order (from PR)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (j.pk) pm.collectionVariables.set('poId', String(j.pk));",
                  "  pm.test('PO created', () => pm.expect(j.potype).to.eql('ORDER'));",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "description": "Creates the ORDER header then `items` in one POST. Set header `vendorid`. Set `linkid` to the REQUEST pk. Do not send `prepby`.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"potype\": \"ORDER\",\n  \"linkid\": {{prId}},\n  \"podate\": \"2026-09-15\",\n  \"ddate\": \"2026-10-01\",\n  \"customerid\": {{customerId}},\n  \"customer_pono\": \"CUST-PO-001\",\n  \"pocategory\": \"Production\",\n  \"stampid\": {{stampId}},\n  \"acexeid\": {{acexeId}},\n  \"termsid\": {{termsId}},\n  \"vendorid\": {{vendorId}},\n  \"vcsdate\": \"2026-09-20\",\n  \"rem\": \"Converted from PR\",\n  \"note\": \"PO note\",\n  \"tqty\": 0,\n  \"active\": true,\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"costcardid\": {{costcardId}},\n      \"styleno\": \"JS-001\",\n      \"vstyleno\": \"V-001\",\n      \"vendorid\": {{vendorId}},\n      \"qty\": 10,\n      \"size\": \"7,8,9\",\n      \"spcs\": \"4,3,3\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/purchase-order/po/"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create purchase order (standalone)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (j.pk) pm.collectionVariables.set('poId', String(j.pk));",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "description": "ORDER with no source PR. Omit `linkid` or send null. Header `vendorid` is still required for a real vendor.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"potype\": \"ORDER\",\n  \"linkid\": null,\n  \"podate\": \"2026-09-15\",\n  \"ddate\": \"2026-10-01\",\n  \"customerid\": {{customerId}},\n  \"customer_pono\": \"CUST-PO-001\",\n  \"pocategory\": \"Production\",\n  \"stampid\": {{stampId}},\n  \"acexeid\": {{acexeId}},\n  \"termsid\": {{termsId}},\n  \"vendorid\": {{vendorId}},\n  \"vcsdate\": \"2026-09-20\",\n  \"rem\": \"Standalone PO\",\n  \"note\": \"PO note\",\n  \"tqty\": 0,\n  \"active\": true,\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"costcardid\": {{costcardId}},\n      \"styleno\": \"JS-001\",\n      \"vstyleno\": \"V-001\",\n      \"vendorid\": {{vendorId}},\n      \"qty\": 10,\n      \"size\": \"7,8,9\",\n      \"spcs\": \"4,3,3\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/purchase-order/po/"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get purchase order detail",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/purchase-order/po/{{poId}}/"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update purchase order",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"vcsdate\": \"2026-09-20\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/purchase-order/po/{{poId}}/"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Cancel purchase order",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "description": "There is no `/cancel/` action. Set cancellation fields on the header.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"canc_dt\": \"2026-09-15\",\n  \"canc_rem\": \"Cancelled\",\n  \"canc_user\": \"postman\",\n  \"active\": false\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/purchase-order/po/{{poId}}/"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List lines for this PO",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/purchase-order/po/{{poId}}/lines/"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Add extra line to this PO",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (j.pk) pm.collectionVariables.set('lineId', String(j.pk));",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "description": "Optional extra line. Saving an ORDER line with `costcardid` copies the cost card into `POCostCard`.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"poid\": {{poId}},\n  \"costcardid\": {{costcardId}},\n  \"styleno\": \"JS-001\",\n  \"vstyleno\": \"V-001\",\n  \"vendorid\": {{vendorId}},\n  \"qty\": 5,\n  \"size\": \"7,8\",\n  \"spcs\": \"3,2\",\n  \"active\": true\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/purchase-order/po-line/"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete purchase order",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/purchase-order/po/{{poId}}/"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Lines (shared)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List all lines",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "description": "Optional `?poid={{poId}}` or `{{prId}}`.",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/purchase-order/po-line/?poid={{poId}}&limit=20"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get line detail",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/purchase-order/po-line/{{lineId}}/"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update line",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"qty\": 12,\n  \"size\": \"7,8,9\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/purchase-order/po-line/{{lineId}}/"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete line",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/purchase-order/po-line/{{lineId}}/"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
